368
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:27,840
Stay in bed for today.
We'll take care of the rest.

369
00:21:29,430 --> 00:21:31,600
But I'm fine now.

370
00:21:31,600 --> 00:21:33,140
Well, that's good for you.

371
